<![CDATA[<h1>23. 面向对象：封装、继承与多态</h1><p>Author: Chiyuki(l12345p9876x0@gmail.com)</p>
        
          <p>封装、继承、多态是面向对象的三大特征。类与对象的语法见 <a href="/post/22-oop-classes/">类与对象</a>，这一篇讲三者各自的实现方式，以及把它们串起来的 MRO。</p>
<h2 id="封装">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%b0%81%e8%a3%85"></a>
封装
</h2><p>封装的目的与 Java 完全一致，只有实现方式不同：</p>
<ol>
<li>隐藏内部实现——把数据和操作数据的方法绑在一起，外部不必知道内部如何存储和处理；</li>
<li>保证数据安全——限制外部随意修改，通过统一接口做校验、日志、联动更新；</li>
<li>降低耦合——外部只依赖暴露的接口，内部实现变了，只要接口不变就不用改外部代码。</li>
</ol>
<p>Java 把「私有化属性」当作实现封装的唯一常规手段，于是有了「私有化 = 封装」的印象；Python 提供了多种更灵活的方式，私有化只是其中一种，而且不是最常用的。</p>
<h3 id="约定式封装单下划线-_attr">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e7%ba%a6%e5%ae%9a%e5%bc%8f%e5%b0%81%e8%a3%85%e5%8d%95%e4%b8%8b%e5%88%92%e7%ba%bf-_attr"></a>
约定式封装：单下划线 <code>_attr</code>
</h3><p>属性或方法以单个下划线开头（<code>self._age</code>、<code>def _calc_score(self)</code>），向其他开发者传递信号：这是内部实现，外部不要直接访问。Python 不会做任何语法限制，PyCharm 等检查工具会对外部访问给出提示，靠的是约定。下划线含义的完整规则见 <a href="/post/03-syntax-basics/">标识符与命名</a>。</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">class</span> <span class="nc">Student</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">def</span> <span class="fm">__init__</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">math</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">english</span><span class="p">):</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="bp">self</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">math</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">math</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="bp">self</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">english</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">english</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="bp">self</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">_total</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">math</span> <span class="o">+</span> <span class="n">english</span>  <span class="c1"># 内部属性，外部无需关注</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="c1"># 内部实现：单下划线标识，外部不要调用</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">_calc_average</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="p">):</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="k">return</span> <span class="bp">self</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">_total</span> <span class="o">/</span> <span class="mi">2</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="c1"># 外部接口：公开方法，供外部调用</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">get_average</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="p">):</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="k">return</span> <span class="bp">self</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">_calc_average</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">s</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">Student</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">90</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">80</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">s</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">get_average</span><span class="p">())</span>  <span class="c1"># 正确用法</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">s</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">_total</span><span class="p">)</span>         <span class="c1"># 语法上能跑，PyCharm 会警告</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">s</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">_calc_average</span><span class="p">())</span>  <span class="c1"># 语法上能跑，PyCharm 会警告</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">85.0
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">170
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">85.0
</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id="接口式封装property">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e6%8e%a5%e5%8f%a3%e5%bc%8f%e5%b0%81%e8%a3%85property"></a>
接口式封装：<code>@property</code>
</h3><p>这是替代 Java getter/setter 的方案，目标是「给属性加逻辑，同时保持 <code>对象.属性</code> 这种简洁接口」（<code>@property</code> 本身是装饰器的应用，见 装饰器）：</p>
<ul>
<li>用 <code>@property</code> 标记一个返回属性值的方法，称为 getter；</li>
<li>用 <code>@getter方法名.setter</code> 标记一个设置属性值的方法，称为 setter；</li>
<li>封装对调用方完全透明，以后给原本公开的属性加上校验，外部代码不用改；</li>
<li><code>@property</code> 装饰的方法名不要和实例属性重名，否则无限递归。</li>
</ul>
<p>原来没有校验的 <code>Person</code>：</p>
        
