<![CDATA[<h1>22. 面向对象：类与对象</h1><p>Author: Chiyuki(l12345p9876x0@gmail.com)</p>
        
          <p>面向过程把问题拆成一串步骤，面向对象把问题看成一组互相作用的对象。Python 两种范式都支持，程序变大之后，后者更容易扩展。这一篇讲类与对象本身：定义类、实例化、<code>self</code>、属性、三种方法、魔法方法，以及在运行时增删成员。封装、继承、多态见 <a href="/post/23-oop-encapsulation-inheritance-polymorphism/">封装、继承与多态</a>。</p>
<h2 id="面向过程与面向对象">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e9%9d%a2%e5%90%91%e8%bf%87%e7%a8%8b%e4%b8%8e%e9%9d%a2%e5%90%91%e5%af%b9%e8%b1%a1"></a>
面向过程与面向对象
</h2><table>
	<thead>
			<tr>
					<th></th>
					<th>面向过程</th>
					<th>面向对象</th>
			</tr>
	</thead>
	<tbody>
			<tr>
					<td>关注点</td>
					<td>解决问题的步骤</td>
					<td>涉及哪些对象、对象之间如何交互</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td>组织单位</td>
					<td>函数</td>
					<td>类与对象</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td>数据与操作</td>
					<td>分离，数据在函数之间传来传去</td>
					<td>绑在同一个类里</td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
					<td>适合</td>
					<td>简单、一次性的任务</td>
					<td>需要扩展和复用的程序</td>
			</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
<h3 id="做菜两种写法">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%81%9a%e8%8f%9c%e4%b8%a4%e7%a7%8d%e5%86%99%e6%b3%95"></a>
做菜：两种写法
</h3><p>面向过程把做饭拆成五个函数，按顺序调用：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">buy</span><span class="p">():</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;去超市购买食材...&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">wash</span><span class="p">():</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;洗菜...&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">cut</span><span class="p">():</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;切菜...&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">cook</span><span class="p">():</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;开始烹饪...&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">serve</span><span class="p">():</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;上菜啦！&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">buy</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">wash</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">cut</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">cook</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">serve</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">去超市购买食材...
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">洗菜...
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">切菜...
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">开始烹饪...
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">上菜啦！
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>流程直白，但没有通用性：想做沙拉（不切不炒）、红烧肉（多一步烹饪）、紫菜汤（只煮），要么重写，要么往函数里加分支，函数越堆越乱。</p>
<p>面向对象先定义一个「菜」的模板，再让每种菜自己决定怎么做：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">class</span> <span class="nc">Dish</span><span class="p">:</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">def</span> <span class="fm">__init__</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">name</span><span class="p">):</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="bp">self</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">name</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">name</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">prepare</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="p">):</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="k">pass</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">class</span> <span class="nc">Salad</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">Dish</span><span class="p">):</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">prepare</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="p">):</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;为制作 </span><span class="si">{</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">name</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2"> 购买食材。&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;清洗 </span><span class="si">{</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">name</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2"> 的蔬菜。&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;切 </span><span class="si">{</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">name</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2"> 的蔬菜。&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;将 </span><span class="si">{</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">name</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2"> 装盘。&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">class</span> <span class="nc">Stew</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">Dish</span><span class="p">):</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">prepare</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="p">):</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;为制作 </span><span class="si">{</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">name</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2"> 购买食材。&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;清洗 </span><span class="si">{</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">name</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2"> 的肉。&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;切 </span><span class="si">{</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">name</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2"> 的肉。&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;烹饪 </span><span class="si">{</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">name</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2">。&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;将 </span><span class="si">{</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">name</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2"> 装盘。&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">class</span> <span class="nc">Soup</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">Dish</span><span class="p">):</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">prepare</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="p">):</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;为制作 </span><span class="si">{</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">name</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2"> 购买食材。&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="sa">f</span><span class="s2">&#34;煮 </span><span class="si">{</span><span class="bp">self</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">name</span><span class="si">}</span><span class="s2">。&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">salad</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">Salad</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;蔬菜沙拉&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">stew</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">Stew</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;红烧肉&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">soup</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">Soup</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;紫菜鸡蛋汤&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">salad</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">prepare</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">stew</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">prepare</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">soup</span><span class="o">.</span><span class="n">prepare</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">为制作 蔬菜沙拉 购买食材。
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">清洗 蔬菜沙拉 的蔬菜。
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">切 蔬菜沙拉 的蔬菜。
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">将 蔬菜沙拉 装盘。
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">为制作 红烧肉 购买食材。
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">清洗 红烧肉 的肉。
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">切 红烧肉 的肉。
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">烹饪 红烧肉。
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">将 红烧肉 装盘。
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">为制作 紫菜鸡蛋汤 购买食材。
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">煮 紫菜鸡蛋汤。
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>数据（菜名）和操作（准备过程）放在同一个类里，这是封装；三种菜各自实现 <code>prepare</code>，同一个调用 <code>菜.prepare()</code> 得到不同结果，这是多态。以后再加菜品，只要写一个新子类，已有代码一行都不用动。</p>
        
